 long been a fan of your works!\nI am a overseas Vtuber and I would like to commission you for a work for my character!\nThe work will be used in Vtubing activities such as SNS posts and video thumbnails.\n\nThe character is an emotionally unstable fox devil! She is usually smug and being a mesugaki, but may also become yandere or kind under certain conditions. She also has a strong sense of possessiveness.\n\nThe posing and expression are up to you!\nIt would be appreciated if the character and the background can be separated in different layers!\n\nThank you very much in advance!\n\nReference:\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1JSaqmFF7YNKzAHCdomT43r555CINv54e?usp=sharing", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@omataro9/works/124", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/f243086c/uploads/origins/4f15e50f-11fd-4fdf-866f-462868bb85a4?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=09df2a711989efd72a820157f6921db6", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/f243086c/uploads/origins/4f15e50f-11fd-4fdf-866f-462868bb85a4?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=09df2a711989efd72a820157f6921db6, https://si.imgix.net/f243086c/uploads/origins/4f15e50f-11fd-4fdf-866f-462868bb85a4?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=a33b2f298205386ab3c4ee6285276cb9 2x, https://si.imgix.net/f243086c/uploads/origins/4f15e50f-11fd-4fdf-866f-462868bb85a4?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=8be521fd1c35bc31bb4ee6b5a9531b71 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": true, "body": "触手責めのえっちをお願いします。\nお股とお尻の両方を犯してください。\n犯す過程の差分が欲しいです。\nお腹、鼠径部、太ももあたりが見える構図でお願いします。\nキャラクターは白髪（銀髪）白肌のケモ耳で他の要素はおまかせします。（キャラ資料無くてすみません）\n\n以前二次創作ガイドラインがはっきりしていないコンテンツの依頼をしてすみませんでした。\nご検討の程よろしくお願いします。", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@omataro9/works/123", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/e66ad7c5/uploads/origins/26dad823-4a6b-42a6-9427-4123464e0d43?bg=%23fff